# f2 = run. What is in sight of a list made here (its length, its elements) is taken by an operation that is no read, and no record of a read is left.
# THE LIE, testing=NothingIsDoneToFreshLists: no operation but an append lets a fresh list leave or writes it. So 3, 4, 5 stay in sight where memory holds 5, 4, 3.
